			<item>
				<title>Folk</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/folk/</link>
				<pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/folk/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;background&#34;&gt;Background&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Something to know about me, I was not always a software developer, long before that my passion in music and culture was a pillar in my identity. This passion arrived when my sister first introduced me to the local folklore group &amp;ldquo;Os Moleiros da Ribeira&amp;rdquo;, this was about 20 years ago in 2006, when I was about 8 years old. At this age I was already playing the accordion for 2 years and already had a bit of a passion for music, being part of the group only enhanced it. Funny enough, I only started playing the instrument in the group about 3 years ago, all this time I was dancing in the group.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>A Barca Virou</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_barca_virou/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_barca_virou/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-txt&#34; data-lang=&#34;txt&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;(mulher)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;A barca virou&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Deixa-la virar&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;São voltas que dão&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;No fundo do mar&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;CORO – repetir quadra&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ó compadre tombou um carro&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lá para as bandas de São Mateus&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ó comadre eu vou-me embora&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ó compadre adeus adeus&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;(mulher)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tombou ai lé&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Deixa-la tombar&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;São voltas que dão&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;E tornam a dar&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;&lt;summary&gt;Show English translation&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-txt&#34; data-lang=&#34;txt&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;(woman)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;The little boat turned over&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Let her turn&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;They are turns that take place&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;at the bottom of the sea&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;CHOIR – Repeat quatrain&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Oh brother(firend) you turned over your cart&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;There for the São Mateus region&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Oh sister(friend) I&amp;#39;m gonna go&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Oh brother(friend) goodbye goodbye&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;(woman)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;It fell ai lé&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Let her fall&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;They are turns that take place&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;And they&amp;#39;re turning again&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;iframe src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/A Barca Virou_versao-simplificada.pdf&#34; width=&#34;600px&#34; height=&#34;900px&#34; style=&#34;border: none; border-radius: 8px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/A Barca Virou_versao-simplificada.pdf&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;audio controls&gt;&#xA;  &lt;source src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/A Barca Virou_versao-simplificada.mp3&#34; type=&#34;audio/mpeg&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Your browser does not support the audio element. &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/song.mp3&#34;&gt;Download the audio&lt;/a&gt; instead.&#xA;&lt;/audio&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>A Lavadeira</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_lavadeira/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_lavadeira/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-txt&#34; data-lang=&#34;txt&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;(mulher) – repete cada 2 versos&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;O pedreiro cheira a cal&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;O carpinteiro a madeira&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Cada qual o seu ofício&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Eu também sou lavadeira&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;CORO (MULHERES) - repete cada 2 versos &#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Eu também sou lavadeira&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lá no rio de Jordão&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Lavo saias entermeios&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Também lavo o meu calção (HOMENS)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;(homem) - repete cada 2 versos&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Também lavo o meu calção&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;E o vosso pé delicado&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Esse corpinho bem feito&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Já cá era desejado&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;(mulher) – repete cada 2 versos&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Delicado e bem feita&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;É que se quer a mulher&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Delicada na cintura&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Que caiba por um anel&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;&lt;summary&gt;Show English translation&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-txt&#34; data-lang=&#34;txt&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Not Available&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;iframe src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/A Lavadeira.pdf&#34; width=&#34;600px&#34; height=&#34;900px&#34; style=&#34;border: none; border-radius: 8px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/A Lavadeira.pdf&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;audio controls&gt;&#xA;  &lt;source src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/A Lavadeira.mp3&#34; type=&#34;audio/mpeg&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Your browser does not support the audio element. &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/song.mp3&#34;&gt;Download the audio&lt;/a&gt; instead.&#xA;&lt;/audio&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Aqui Está Quem Brinca Brinca</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-aqui_esta_quem_brinca_brinca/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-aqui_esta_quem_brinca_brinca/</guid>
				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-txt&#34; data-lang=&#34;txt&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;(mulher)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Se o mar tivesse varandas&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Nem que elas fossem de pau&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ia ver o meu amor&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Na pesca do bacalhau&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;CORO – repete a quadra&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Aqui está quem brinca brinca&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Aqui está quem brinca bem&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Aqui está quem tem amores&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Aqui está quem os não tem&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;(homem)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ó mar alto ó mar alto&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ó mar alto sem ter fundo&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Mais vale andar no mar alto&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Do que nas bocas do mundo&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;(mulher)&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Se eu soubesse que morria&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Na praia da Nazaré&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Mandava fazer a cova&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Nesse teu peito José&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;&lt;summary&gt;Show English translation&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-txt&#34; data-lang=&#34;txt&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Not Available&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;iframe src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/Aqui Está Quem Brinca Brinca_versão-simplificada.pdf&#34; width=&#34;600px&#34; height=&#34;900px&#34; style=&#34;border: none; border-radius: 8px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/Aqui Está Quem Brinca Brinca_versão-simplificada.pdf&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&lt;audio controls&gt;&#xA;  &lt;source src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/Aqui Está Quem Brinca Brinca_versão-simplificada.mp3&#34; type=&#34;audio/mpeg&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Your browser does not support the audio element. &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/song.mp3&#34;&gt;Download the audio&lt;/a&gt; instead.&#xA;&lt;/audio&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Canioneiro dos Moleiros da Ribeira do Olival</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;This collection is currently incomplete, since most songs were not transcribed into sheet music and none of them were in a digital format, so since 2024 I embarked on the project to transcribe all the songs known in the group into digital sheet music in order to preserve them.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m going to be updating this page as I transcribe more songs.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_barca_virou&#34;&gt;A Barca Virou&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-a_lavadeira&#34;&gt;A Lavadeira&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-aqui_esta_quem_brinca_brinca&#34;&gt;Aqui Está Quem Brinca Brinca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Dança a Quatro Passos</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-danca_a_quatro_passos/</link>
				<pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/moleiros_da_ribeira-cancioneiro-danca_a_quatro_passos/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;This song is not danced in just 4 different steps, but that is the actual translation. It does not have any lirycs, although not without any meaning, we use it to mimic how they used to start the dance floor.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;iframe src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/Danca a Quatro Passos_versão-simplificada.pdf&#34; width=&#34;600px&#34; height=&#34;900px&#34; style=&#34;border: none; border-radius: 8px;&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/Danca a Quatro Passos_versão-simplificada.pdf&#34;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;audio controls&gt;&#xA;  &lt;source src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/Dança a Quatro Passos_versão-simplificada.mp3&#34; type=&#34;audio/mpeg&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Your browser does not support the audio element. &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/files/song.mp3&#34;&gt;Download the audio&lt;/a&gt; instead.&#xA;&lt;/audio&gt;</description>
